<title>FRANCE: Global One in three billion franc telecom deal.</title>
<headline>Global One in three billion franc telecom deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global One has won a three billion franc five-year contract for managing the world telecommunications for bank Credit Lyonnais, France Telecom said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Global One is a joint venture of France Telecom, Deutsche Telekom and Sprint Corp.</p>
<p>The contract involves over 2,500 sites.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
